flowchart LR
  A[An unexpected email] --> B{Wants a password, money or a file?}
  B -- Yes --> R[Report it]
  B -- No --> C{Sender and link look right?}
  C -- No --> R
  C -- Yes --> D[Carry on]
  R --> E{Clicked or typed anything?}
  E -- Yes --> F[Call 4444 now]
  E -- No --> G[Done: the desk takes over]
